{'symbol': 'YUM', 'date': '2023-01-20 12:21:00', 'title': "AIRRACK & PIZZA HUT BREAK GUINNESS WORLD RECORDS™ TITLE FOR WORLD'S LARGEST PIZZA", 'text': "TOGETHER THEY MAKE HISTORY SETTING THE RECORD TO LAUNCH THE RETURN OF PIZZA HUT'S BIG NEW YORKER ALL PIZZA FROM WORLD'S LARGEST PIZZA WAS DONATED TO LOS ANGELES CHARITIES PLANO, TEXAS , JAN. 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- \xa0 AIRRACK , A POPULAR CONTENT CREATOR AND YOUTUBE STAR, AND PIZZA HUT TEAMED UP TO BREAK THE GUINNESS WORLD RECORDS TITLE FOR THE WORLD'S LARGEST PIZZA ON JANUARY 18 IN LOS ANGELES, CA. TOGETHER, THEY SET THE RECORD TO CELEBRATE BOTH THE RETURN OF PIZZA HUT'S ICONIC FAN-FAVORITE PIZZA, 'THE BIG NEW YORKER,' AS WELL AS AIRRACK HITTING 10 MILLION SUBSCRIBERS."}